  "prefLabel": "En 1018.15 Energy Storage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1018.15 Energy Storage.\n\n(a) If the applicant is seeking approval for an energy storage device, that is co-located with load, other than station service load, pursuant to an application governed by this chapter, the utility shall not require a separate and additional request for new service for the interconnection of new or modified load. The utility shall review the co-located energy storage device pursuant to the processes in this chapter and not pursuant to En 300.\n\n(b) If the applicant is seeking approval for an energy storage device not co-located with load, other than station service load, the utility shall apply the interconnection requirements established in the utility TIR.\n\n(c) Energy storage devices shall be screened or studied according to the proposed facility’s design and operating characteristics. If the facility limits export or import pursuant to En 1013, screening or study of the device shall use export capacity or import capacity instead of nameplate rating, except when assessing fault current contribution.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nRule(s) | Statute\n\nEn 1001 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1002 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:1; RSA 362-A:9; RSA 374-F:2, VII-VIII; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1003 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1004 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9; RSA 378:3; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1005 - En 1007 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1008.01 - En 1008.05 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1008.06 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); RSA 362-A:9, XIII; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1008.07 - En 1008.10 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1009 - En 1010 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); RSA 374:2; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1011.01 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1011.02 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); RSA 362-A:9, XIII; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1011.03 – En 1012.08 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1012.09 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); RSA 362-A:9, XIII; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1012.10 – En 1012.13 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1012.14 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); RSA 362-A:9, XIII; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1013 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1014 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1015 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, X(a); Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1016 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 365:1-4; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1017 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nEn 1018 | RSA 12-P:5, IV; RSA 362-A:9, XIII; RSA 362-A:1; Laws 2024, ch. 287\n\nAPPENDIX B: INCORPORATION BY REFERENCE INFORMATION\n\nRule | Title (date) | Source\n\nEn 1002.09, En 1002.50, En 1005.01(a), En 1009.03(b)(2), En 1009.03(b)(3), En 1011.06(d), En 1011.09, En 1011.10, En 1013.03(b)(2), En 1018.02, En 1018.09(c) | IEEE Std 1547™-2018 - IEEE Standard for Interconnection and Interoperability of Distributed Energy Resources with Associated Electric Power System Interfaces, dated 4/6/2018 | Institute of Electrical and Electronic Engineers, Inc., 445 Hoes Lane, Piscataway, NJ 08854 Available for purchase at: https://store.accuristech.com/standards/ieee-1547-2018?product_id=1983168 for $172.00 PDF $215.00 Printed Edition $271.00 Printed Edition and PDF\n\nEn 1002.09, En 1005.01(b), En 1013.03(b)(2) | IEEE Std 1547.1™-2020 - IEEE Standard Conformance Test Procedures for Equipment Interconnecting Distributed Energy Resources with Electric Power Systems and Associated Interfaces, dated 5/21/2020 | Institute of Electrical and Electronic Engineers, Inc., 445 Hoes Lane, Piscataway, NJ 08854 Available for purchase at: https://store.accuristech.com/standards/ieee-1547-1-2020?product_id=2045401 for $225.00 PDF $281.00 Printed Edition $350.00 Printed Edition and PDF\n\nEn 1005.01(d) | IEEE Std 1547.2™-2023 – IEEE App